1
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,319
Based on the initial survey of the scene,

2
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:53,279
the victim's wrists

3
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:54,800
show marks from being bound.

4
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,319
The fatal wound is to the throat.

5
00:05:56,399 --> 00:05:58,040
This is suspected to be gang-related.

6
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,519
Notify the Anti-Triad Unit to assist.

7
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:03,439
Yes, sir.

8
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,319
Officer Chen.

9
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,920
Well? Is he conscious?

10
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,720
He's conscious.

11
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:39,240
But his vocal cords are damaged.

12
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,759
So he can't speak for now.

13
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,199
Luckily he's in good shape.

14
00:06:43,319 --> 00:06:45,519
His injuries are lighter than we expected.

15
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:47,319
But he's only just stabilized.

16
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,279
So don't question him too long.

17
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,360
Alright, thank you.

18
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,319
Tough as nails, aren't you, Bro Pao.

19
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,639
Surviving even this.

20
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:56,720
I've got to hand it to you.

21
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,240
The forensics report is in.

22
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,199
The victim is Camel.

23
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,800
You did it, didn't you?

24
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,160
You and Camel hacked each other last time.

25
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,720
You couldn't finish him off.

26
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,319
That didn't sit right with you.

27
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:14,920
This time you pulled it off.

28
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,319
Congratulations, Bro Pao.

29
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,519
Take it easy, Bro Pao.

30
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,360
I know it wasn't you.

31
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,920
You're not that clean and quick.

32
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:30,959
It was Xie Guanhong.

33
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,160
You're smart.

34
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,839
This time you won't walk away clean.

35
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,199
You survived,

36
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,560
but that's just dumb luck.

37
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:42,319
But this time, the law will nail you.

38
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,480
All that hard work you put in,

39
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,639
all those years on the job.

40
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,160
Do the math.

41
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,000
Can I put you behind bars

42
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,120
till the day they bury you?

43
00:07:58,639 --> 00:07:59,439
Bro Pao.

44
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:02,720
Are you hoping to be released on bail?

45
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,000
Will Xie Guanhong let you off, though?

46
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:09,959
Could it be you dead in the alley next?

47
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,959
If you really want to save your own skin,

48
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,879
then cooperate with the police.

49
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,720
Be my informant.

50
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,439
At least I can plead with the judge.

51
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,759
Try to shave off three to five years.

52
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,639
Like the old saying goes,

53
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,000
he's got no honor, so neither do you.

54
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:32,600
It's not really betraying your precious code.

55
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,360
Bro Pao.

56
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,840
Your wife's coming by in a bit, too.

57
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:45,000
What happens if you die?

58
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:26,720
I'm Inspector Liu Zhenfeng, Major Crimes.

59
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,240
Xie Guanhong isn't home.

60
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,840
We're not here for Xie Guanhong.

61
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:30,440
Zihao.

62
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:31,039
Zihao.

63
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:31,759
What are you doing?

64
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:32,559
Mom.

65
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:33,440
What exactly did Zihao do?

66
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,559
What evidence do you have to arrest him?

67
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,559
Xie Zihao is a suspect

68
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:37,000
in a major murder case.

69
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,840
Please cooperate with the investigation.

70
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,840
Or I'll arrest you along with him.

71
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,200
A Fei, Zihao's been arrested.

72
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,759
All these years I've been coming here,

73
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:07,759
this place is so old and dirty now.

74
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:09,919
And that air conditioner...

75
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,559
It smells so weird.

76
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,519
This is bad for your health.

77
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:15,360
Bad for you, bad for me,

78
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,879
bad for everyone.

79
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,440
Xie Guanhong,

80
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,440
you'd better cooperate.

81
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
The evidence is solid.

82
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,600
You killed someone. You can't run.

83
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,519
I own a construction company.

84
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:30,799
The prices are fair,

85
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:32,240
and the quality's pretty good too.

86
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,919
How about I fix this place up for you?

87
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,799
I'll definitely do a great job.

88
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:38,000
You think you're playing the silent game?

89
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:41,840
Think we're Anti-Triad Unit pushovers?

90
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:46,519
You're suspected of murder, Mr. Xie.

91
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:57,759
Sorry I'm late.

92
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:02,360
May I?

93
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:05,720
Thank you.

94
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,080
My client

95
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,559
can begin answering questions now.

96
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:14,559
You say you weren't at the primary scene,

97
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:17,279
but we collected your footprints there.

98
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,039
There's no point in resisting.

99
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:20,799
Xie Guanhong,

100
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,279
we already have evidence pointing to you.

101
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,960
Interrogating you now

102
00:11:26,279 --> 00:11:28,399
is just a chance to reduce your sentence.

103
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,360
I didn't have a choice before.

104
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:44,120
Now I want to be a good guy.

105
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:49,879
I'm sorry.

106
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,519
I'm a cop.

107
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,759
Calm down!

108
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,840
You've watched too many cop movies.

109
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,960
Bro Pao is already working with us.

110
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,440
He confessed that you killed Camel.

111
00:12:09,279 --> 00:12:11,320
He can testify in court anytime.

112
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,000
Xie Guanhong.

113
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,080
You also burned down Bro Pao's home.

114
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,039
Calm down!

115
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,799
Sorry to interrupt.

116
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,799
Officers,

117
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,759
The evidence you currently hold,

118
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:24,039
and the witness's testimony,

119
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,399
are not enough to constitute

120
00:12:25,399 --> 00:12:26,919
a complete and valid chain of evidence.

121
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:29,240
What's more,

122
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,840
your interrogation methods

123
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,120
very likely amount to leading questions.

124
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,120
Once we're in court,

125
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,120
you'll see if this evidence holds up.

126
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:39,399
When the judge summons you on all this,

127
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:41,879
you can explain it to the jury.

128
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:44,240
Sorry to interrupt again.

129
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,720
Officers.

130
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,919
The only witness you have now

131
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,960
is not in a normal, healthy

132
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:52,720
state capable of rational judgment.

133
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,399
I have the right to suspect

134
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,600
that due to his severe injuries,

135
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,879
he's suffering from delirium.

136
00:12:57,120 --> 00:13:00,840
So his testimony isn't credible enough.

137
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,600
Does it hurt, doing this the whole time?

138
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,279
It's been handed to the Anti-Triad Unit.

139
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,639
The higher-ups told us to pull out.

140
00:13:19,279 --> 00:13:20,039
What?

141
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:20,919
When did this happen?

142
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,000
Who approved it?

143
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:24,399
Officer Liu signed it himself.

144
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:30,080
Looks like our talk today

145
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,480
can come to an end.

146
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,120
No manners.

147
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,559
Bro Pao got hurt.

148
00:13:49,559 --> 00:13:50,919
It's pitiful, yes.

149
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,559
But you can't just...

150
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:54,000
Whatever they say,

151
00:13:54,039 --> 00:13:55,559
you just believe it.

152
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,759
The bad blood between us,

153
00:13:57,759 --> 00:13:59,159
everyone in the whole company,

154
00:13:59,159 --> 00:14:00,159
who doesn't know about it?

155
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,600
He just wanted to kill me.

156
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,759
Bro Pao's badly injured,

157
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,000
and I'm locked up in here.

158
00:14:07,919 --> 00:14:09,000
Go visit him for me, will you?

159
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:12,320
Sure.

160
00:14:12,639 --> 00:14:13,799
I'll prepare some gifts

161
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:14,639
to bring along.

162
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:22,159
Wipe your shoes clean for the hospital.

163
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:24,159
Don't cause anyone trouble.

164
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:25,879
Understood.
